From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 06:05:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dxgi: Implement CreateSwapChainForComposition() for Direct3D
 11 devices.

Excel's grid animations (tables, pivot tables, sorting, filters, data
validation, notes) present through a swapchain made for composition and
shown by a Windows.UI.Composition surface.  With the stub it tried again
on every frame, over seven hundred times in one sweep, each attempt
thrown and caught as an exception.

A swapchain for composition is an ordinary one on a hidden window of its
own, which a thread of dxgi's owns, so that whichever thread releases
the swapchain its window goes with it.  A present does not go to that
window: the whole buffer, dirty rectangles already composited into it,
is copied into a texture of the device, and whoever shows the swapchain
is called.  The composition reaches that through
IWineDXGICompositionSwapChain.  An interval waits for as many frames at
60 Hz since the last present.

GetHwnd() fails for such a swapchain, GetDesc1() keeps its alpha mode,
and GetFrameStatistics() answers for it, with
DXGI_ERROR_FRAME_STATISTICS_DISJOINT before the first present:
Office's AirSpace asks for them right after creating the swapchain, and
the stub's E_NOTIMPL made it fail fast (Mso20win32client.dll writes to
address 0 and raises int 0x29), taking Excel down.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/dxgi/dxgi_private.h b/dlls/dxgi/dxgi_private.h
index f77ae8e7417..363b52af0f1 100644
--- a/dlls/dxgi/dxgi_private.h
+++ b/dlls/dxgi/dxgi_private.h
@@ -187,6 +187,18 @@ struct d3d11_swapchain
     LONG in_set_fullscreen_state;
     BOOL presented_full;
     struct wined3d_texture *front_copy;
+
+    /* A swapchain for composition presents to the composition that shows it, not to a window: wined3d draws
+     * with a hidden one, and each present copies the whole buffer into a texture the composition draws. */
+    IWineDXGICompositionSwapChain IWineDXGICompositionSwapChain_iface;
+    HWND composition_window;
+    DXGI_ALPHA_MODE alpha_mode;
+    CRITICAL_SECTION composition_cs;
+    IDXGISurface *presented;
+    UINT presented_version;
+    struct composition_listener *listeners;
+    unsigned int listener_count;
+    LARGE_INTEGER last_present;
 };
 
 HRESULT d3d11_swapchain_init(struct d3d11_swapchain *swapchain, struct dxgi_device *device,
@@ -197,6 +209,8 @@ HRESULT d3d12_swapchain_create(IWineDXGIFactory *factory, ID3D12CommandQueue *qu
         IDXGISwapChain1 **swapchain);
 
 BOOL dxgi_validate_swapchain_desc(const DXGI_SWAP_CHAIN_DESC1 *desc);
+HRESULT dxgi_create_composition_swapchain(IWineDXGIFactory *factory, IUnknown *device,
+        const DXGI_SWAP_CHAIN_DESC1 *desc, IDXGIOutput *output, IDXGISwapChain1 **swapchain);
 BOOL dxgi_validate_swapchain_fullscreen_desc(const DXGI_SWAP_CHAIN_FULLSCREEN_DESC *desc);
 
